msgid "Bind one LAN port to the operator IPTV VLAN. Applying the configuration removes the selected port from br-lan."
msgstr "将一个 LAN 口绑定到运营商 IPTV VLAN。应用配置时会把所选端口移出 br-lan。"

msgid "Carries DHCP, authentication, video on demand and, when no separate multicast VLAN is set, multicast traffic."
msgstr "承载 DHCP、鉴权和点播；未设置独立组播 VLAN 时也承载组播流量。"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Grant access to IPTV bridge configuration"
msgstr "允许访问 IPTV 网桥配置"

msgid "IPTV LAN port"
msgstr "IPTV LAN 口"

msgid "Leave the multicast VLAN empty when both services use the same VLAN."
msgstr "两种业务共用同一 VLAN 时，请将组播 VLAN 留空。"

msgid "Multicast VLAN"
msgstr "组播 VLAN"

msgid "Network device carrying the operator VLANs, normally pon0."
msgstr "承载运营商 VLAN 的网络设备，通常为 pon0。"

msgid "Optional. In separate multicast VLAN mode, IPv4 multicast flows downstream and IGMP is allowed upstream."
msgstr "可选。使用独立组播 VLAN 时，IPv4 组播向机顶盒下行，并允许 IGMP 上行。"

msgid "Service VLAN"
msgstr "业务 VLAN"

msgid "The selected port is dedicated to the set-top box."
msgstr "所选端口将专用于机顶盒。"

msgid "Uplink device"
msgstr "上联设备"

msgid "Use a Linux network device name containing at most 15 characters."
msgstr "请输入不超过 15 个字符的 Linux 网络设备名称。"

msgid "IGMP upstream VLAN"
msgstr "IGMP 上行 VLAN"

msgid "Optional. Leave empty to use the multicast VLAN, or the service VLAN when no separate multicast VLAN is configured."
msgstr "可选。留空时使用组播 VLAN；未设置独立组播 VLAN 时使用业务 VLAN。"

msgid "Same as multicast traffic"
msgstr "与组播流量相同"
